The story of the most majestic ship has been used many times, but in the game Titanic Honor and Glory You don't have to investigate the sinking. The Titanic serves as the setting for all the main events. A little more about the story: a young man named Robert Morgan was accused of murder (he didn't commit it, of course!), and to find the real culprit, he decides to conduct his own investigation, which leads him to the Titanic.

What are the advantages of the game:
- The time allotted to find the killer is limited - if you don’t manage to find him before the ship crashes, you lose;
- As the game progresses, you will meet many passengers, almost all of whom will have their own unique destinies;
- The developers paid great attention to recreating the ship – with maximum accuracy to the liner that once actually existed;
- Additional mode – exploration, in which the user will not be limited in time, which will allow him to get to know the ship in more detail, its undisclosed secrets and beauty.
- If you've seen the movie and want to relive the Titanic's wreckage, but only in a game, then you simply need to download the game. Titanic Honor and Glory via torrent from us.
